#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-dependencies/pyproject-metadata.xml:27
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>Pyproject-Metadata</application> module contains a data "
"class for PEP 621 metadata with support for <quote>core metadata</quote> "
"(PEP 643) generation."
